0
00:00:01,134 --> 00:00:06,573
Tyra: AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL IS...

1
00:00:06,573 --> 00:00:07,274
YOANNA.

2
00:00:07,274 --> 00:00:08,675
Yoanna:
AAH! IT'S NOT REAL.

3
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:10,210
Tyra: THE COMPETITION
MAY BE OVER...

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,979
Yoanna: HI. GOOD MORNING.
THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME.

5
00:00:11,979 --> 00:00:13,614
Tyra: BUT FOR
12 AMAZING YOUNG WOMEN,

6
00:00:13,614 --> 00:00:15,516
THE ADVENTURE
IS JUST BEGINNING.

7
00:00:15,516 --> 00:00:16,683
Xiomara:
RIGHT NOW.

8
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:18,752
WHO'S MAKING MOVES?
WHO'S NOT?

9
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:20,254
Catie: THE SHOW WAS
COMPLETELY JUST A WARM-UP.

10
00:00:20,254 --> 00:00:22,222
NOW IS, LIKE,
THE REAL COMPETITION.

11
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:23,991
Tyra: WE'LL FIND OUT
WHO'S HOT...

12
00:00:23,991 --> 00:00:25,158
Man: THAT'S SEXY.

13
00:00:25,158 --> 00:00:26,627
April: I LIKE
THE FEELING THAT I GET

14
00:00:26,627 --> 00:00:28,529
WHEN I'M CREATING ART
WITH MY BODY.

15
00:00:28,529 --> 00:00:29,530
Tyra:
WHO'S HOME...

16
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:30,697
Shandi:
THANK YOU.

17
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:32,266
Jenascia:
STILL SLINGIN' CHICKEN WINGS.

18
00:00:32,266 --> 00:00:34,268
Anna: I DON'T REGRET
ANY DECISIONS I MADE.

19
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:36,003
Tyra:
AND WHAT HAPPENS NEXT.

20
00:00:36,003 --> 00:00:37,104
Shandi: BEING ON THE SHOW
MADE ME REALIZE

21
00:00:37,104 --> 00:00:38,972
THIS IS WHAT I WANNA DO.

22
00:00:38,972 --> 00:00:40,307
Mercedes: THIS IS JUST
THE BEGINNING.

23
00:00:40,307 --> 00:00:41,608
Yoanna:
IT'S INSANE.

24
00:00:41,608 --> 00:00:43,010
IT'S LIKE A DREAM
COME TRUE.

25
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:45,312
Tyra: ALL THAT COMING UP
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL:

26
00:00:45,312 --> 00:00:46,980
THE RUNWAY AHEAD."

27
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:50,250
♪♪♪

28
00:01:26,053 --> 00:01:28,622
Tyra: OUR 12 FINALISTS
CAME FROM ALL OVER THE COUNTRY

29
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:30,657
FROM ALL DIFFERENT TYPES
OF RACIAL BACKGROUNDS,

30
00:01:30,657 --> 00:01:33,727
ETHNIC BACKGROUNDS
AND ALL SHAPES AND SIZES.

31
00:01:33,727 --> 00:01:35,162
AND THEY ALL HAD SOMETHING
IN COMMON--

32
00:01:35,162 --> 00:01:38,532
THEY ALL WANTED TO BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

33
00:01:38,532 --> 00:01:41,301
VOTING A GIRL OFF EVERY WEEK
IS REALLY, REALLY DIFFICULT.

34
00:01:41,301 --> 00:01:42,502
I MEAN, I REALLY BOND
WITH THE GIRLS.

35
00:01:42,502 --> 00:01:44,171
I LEARN ABOUT
THEIR PERSONAL LIFE,

36
00:01:44,171 --> 00:01:45,305
THEIR BOYFRIENDS,
THEIR MOMS,

37
00:01:45,305 --> 00:01:47,107
THEIR INSECURITIES, THEIR FEARS.

38
00:01:47,107 --> 00:01:49,676
THE FINAL VOTE
BETWEEN YOANNA AND MERCEDES

39
00:01:49,676 --> 00:01:51,011
WAS REALLY DIFFICULT.

40
00:01:51,011 --> 00:01:52,746
I MEAN, WE WERE FIGHTING
BACK AND FORTH.

41
00:01:52,746 --> 00:01:55,115
I MEAN, ONE MOMENT, I'M
ACTUALLY PULLING FOR YOANNA,

42
00:01:55,115 --> 00:01:57,117
THEN FIVE MINUTES LATER,
I'M PULLING FOR MERCEDES.

43
00:01:57,117 --> 00:01:59,019
MERCEDES WAS SPUNKY.

44
00:01:59,019 --> 00:02:01,021
YOU KNOW, HER PERSONALITY
WAS SO BUBBLY,

45
00:02:01,021 --> 00:02:03,490
AND SHE JUST HAD
THIS LITTLE "TOUGH GIRL,

46
00:02:03,490 --> 00:02:05,225
BUT I'M SWEET AT
THE SAME TIME,"

47
00:02:05,225 --> 00:02:07,127
AND WE WERE LIKE,
"COME ON, MERCEDES.

48
00:02:07,127 --> 00:02:08,261
COME ON TO NEW YORK."

49
00:02:11,498 --> 00:02:12,466
Mercedes:
MY NAME IS MERCEDES.

50
00:02:14,468 --> 00:02:16,236
I AM 21 YEARS OLD.

51
00:02:17,604 --> 00:02:22,175
I WEIGH 120 POUNDS,
AND I HAVE A LOT OF DREAMS.

52
00:02:23,477 --> 00:02:25,646
I ALWAYS USED TO PUT ON
SHOWS FOR MY MOM

53
00:02:25,646 --> 00:02:28,281
AND SING AND DANCE
IN THE LIVING ROOM.

54
00:02:28,281 --> 00:02:29,750
I WANTED TO BE
AN ASTRONAUT.

55
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:32,386
I WANTED TO BE THE FIRST
BLACK AND WHITE WOMAN PRESIDENT.

56
00:02:33,754 --> 00:02:34,755
John:
SHE'S A GREAT GIRL.

57
00:02:34,755 --> 00:02:36,323
SHE'S GOT A LOT OF CHARISMA,
A LOT OF CHARISMA,

58
00:02:36,323 --> 00:02:37,491
AND THAT'S IMPORTANT TO ME.

59
00:02:37,491 --> 00:02:39,459
SHE'S GOT
A GREAT WALK, TOO.

60
00:02:39,459 --> 00:02:41,061
Mary:
MERCEDES IS A FUN GIRL.

61
00:02:41,061 --> 00:02:42,529
I MEAN, SHE'S SILLY.

62
00:02:44,264 --> 00:02:45,632
SHE LIKES TO PLAY
WITH HER BROTHER,

63
00:02:45,632 --> 00:02:47,634
AND THEY LOVE TO, YOU KNOW,
HAVE A GOOD TIME TOGETHER.

64
00:02:47,634 --> 00:02:50,537
(playing "Twinkle, Twinkle,
Little Star")

65
00:02:52,372 --> 00:02:54,374
Mercedes: MY MOM IS
ITALIAN-AMERICAN,

66
00:02:54,374 --> 00:02:57,511
AND MY FATHER
IS AFRICAN-AMERICAN,

67
00:02:57,511 --> 00:03:00,480
AND MY STEPFATHER
IS CHINESE.

68
00:03:01,481 --> 00:03:05,018
GROWING UP IN JERSEY,
I WAS THE RUDEST GIRL EVER.

69
00:03:05,018 --> 00:03:06,186
I WOULD GET INTO FIGHTS.

70
00:03:06,186 --> 00:03:08,088
I WAS IN POSSE 6-1.

71
00:03:08,088 --> 00:03:09,289
(siren wailing)

72
00:03:09,289 --> 00:03:11,258
Mary: WE LIVED IN
A TOUGH AREA, ACTUALLY.

73
00:03:11,258 --> 00:03:13,493
Mercedes: YOU HAD TO HAVE,
LIKE, THE BAGGY PANTS,

74
00:03:13,493 --> 00:03:16,096
THE HOOP EARRINGS
WITH THE BANGS.

75
00:03:16,096 --> 00:03:18,365
MOVING TO VALENCIA, CALIFORNIA,
IT WAS A GOOD NEIGHBORHOOD,

76
00:03:18,365 --> 00:03:20,967
AND I THINK THAT CHANGE
INFLUENCED ME

77
00:03:20,967 --> 00:03:23,203
TO JUST BE
A BETTER PERSON.

78
00:03:23,203 --> 00:03:25,972
IT'S BEEN A CRAZY TURN
OF EVENTS.

79
00:03:27,374 --> 00:03:29,976
I WAS DIAGNOSED WITH LUPUS,
WHICH IS A CHRONIC ILLNESS

80
00:03:29,976 --> 00:03:31,611
THAT ATTACKS
YOUR IMMUNE SYSTEM,

81
00:03:31,611 --> 00:03:34,614
AND I DON'T WANT MY
ROOMMATES TO KNOW.

82
00:03:34,614 --> 00:03:36,316
Janice: MERCEDES,
LATELY I'VE NOTICED

83
00:03:36,316 --> 00:03:38,985
YOUR ENERGY HAS GONE
DOWN A LITTLE.

84
00:03:38,985 --> 00:03:40,287
WHAT HAPPENED TO YOU, GIRL?

85
00:03:40,287 --> 00:03:41,621
Mercedes: I DON'T
WANNA MAKE EXCUSES

86
00:03:41,621 --> 00:03:44,424
THAT I HAVE AN ILLNESS,
BUT I DO.

87
00:03:44,424 --> 00:03:46,760
UM, I HAVE LUPUS.

88
00:03:48,061 --> 00:03:51,398
AFTER JANICE REVEALED
TO THE WORLD THAT I HAD LUPUS,

89
00:03:51,398 --> 00:03:53,400
IT WAS BETTER, BECAUSE
PEOPLE WERE SUPPORTIVE.

90
00:03:56,503 --> 00:03:58,171
Tyra: MERCEDES
HAS THAT PERSONALITY

91
00:03:58,171 --> 00:04:01,541
THAT IS A TOP MODEL PERSONALITY,
AND SHE'S FIGHTING A DISEASE.

92
00:04:01,541 --> 00:04:03,610
SHE HAS THESE THINGS
AND THESE EXPERIENCES

93
00:04:03,610 --> 00:04:04,711
THAT YOU LOOK AT THIS
SWEET GIRL, AND YOU GO,

94
00:04:04,711 --> 00:04:06,113
"WOW, I DIDN'T KNOW THAT."

95
00:04:06,113 --> 00:04:08,482
Nigel: SHE REALLY WAS ONE OF
THE BEST GIRLS ON THE RUNWAY,

96
00:04:08,482 --> 00:04:11,218
BUT THE THING IS,
IS DOES SHE HAVE THE FACE

97
00:04:11,218 --> 00:04:13,153
TO SORT OF GRAB
INTERNATIONAL MARKETS,

98
00:04:13,153 --> 00:04:15,288
THE WHOLE OF AMERICA?

99
00:04:15,288 --> 00:04:17,757
Tyra: AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL IS...

100
00:04:17,757 --> 00:04:20,160
YOANNA.

101
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,295
Mercedes: I WAS DISAPPOINTED
WHEN I WAS ELIMINATED

102
00:04:22,295 --> 00:04:25,232
BECAUSE I WAS LOOKING
ALL THE WAY AT THE LIGHT

103
00:04:25,232 --> 00:04:28,101
AT THE END OF THE TUNNEL,
AND I DIDN'T QUITE GET THERE.

104
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:30,971
IT WAS LIKE TEN SECONDS LEFT
IN A BASKETBALL GAME.

105
00:04:30,971 --> 00:04:35,709
YOU KNOW, THAT LITTLE INCH--
IT SUCKS! IT SUCKS SO HARD!

106
00:04:38,378 --> 00:04:42,115
THE COMPETITION
HAS NOT YET ENDED, FOLKS.

107
00:04:42,115 --> 00:04:45,385
YOANNA, I HEARD, IS IN A SHOW
THIS WEEK FOR FASHION WEEK,

108
00:04:45,385 --> 00:04:47,053
BUT I GOT THE BEST SHOW.

109
00:04:47,053 --> 00:04:49,289
I OPENED UP WITH LLOYD KLEIN,
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

110
00:04:49,289 --> 00:04:50,457
I'M SUPPOSED TO BE
GOING THAT WAY.

111
00:04:52,459 --> 00:04:55,428
Janice: THIS WAS MERCEDES'
FIRST REAL FASHION SHOW.

112
00:04:55,428 --> 00:04:58,598
Mercedes: SO I JUST FINISHED
THE MERCEDES-BENZ FASHION SHOW,

113
00:04:58,598 --> 00:05:02,502
AND NOW I'M GOING TO AUDITION
FOR THE ENYCE,

114
00:05:02,502 --> 00:05:05,172
WHICH I'M REALLY EXCITED
'CAUSE IT PAYS $500,

115
00:05:05,172 --> 00:05:07,040
AND I HAVEN'T HAD
A PAYCHECK IN SIX MONTHS.

116
00:05:09,042 --> 00:05:10,610
OKAY, MY HOPES AND GOALS--

117
00:05:10,610 --> 00:05:14,414
I WANT TO AT LEAST GRACE
THE COVER ON A "VOGUE."

118
00:05:14,414 --> 00:05:16,283
I WOULD LIKE TO PURSUE
ACTING,

119
00:05:16,283 --> 00:05:18,752
AND I WOULD LIKE
TO HELP PEOPLE WITH LUPUS.

120
00:05:18,752 --> 00:05:21,521
I'M JUST GONNA
KEEP ON GOING.

121
00:05:21,521 --> 00:05:23,657
Tyra: MERCEDES JUST SIGNED
WITH NEW MODEL MANAGEMENT

122
00:05:23,657 --> 00:05:25,091
IN LOS ANGELES.

123
00:05:25,091 --> 00:05:27,394
SHE HAS AN AD COMING OUT
IN "SEVENTEEN" MAGAZINE,

124
00:05:27,394 --> 00:05:29,162
AND SHE'S STARRING IN
AN INDEPENDENT FILM

125
00:05:29,162 --> 00:05:30,530
CALLED "LOVE NEST."

126
00:05:34,401 --> 00:05:37,237
Sara: THIS EXPERIENCE HAS
CHANGED MY LIFE MIRACULOUSLY.

127
00:05:37,237 --> 00:05:39,673
PEOPLE RECOGNIZE ME
ON THE STREET, LIKE,

128
00:05:39,673 --> 00:05:41,575
RUNNING UP TO ME,
FOLLOWING ME IN STORES,

129
00:05:41,575 --> 00:05:43,443
SHOUTING MY NAME OUT.

130
00:05:43,443 --> 00:05:46,379
I AM HALF-PERSIAN,
HALF-AMERICAN.

131
00:05:47,581 --> 00:05:48,582
Mercedes:
WHAT IS THAT?

132
00:05:48,582 --> 00:05:49,583
Sara:
IT'S FROM IRAN.

133
00:05:49,583 --> 00:05:51,651
MOSQUES. IT'S HAND-PAINTED.

134
00:05:51,651 --> 00:05:54,721
I AM SO PROUD OF MY
PERSIAN CULTURE,

135
00:05:54,721 --> 00:05:58,592
BUT TO MY IRANIAN FAMILY,
MY FATHER, WHO'S MUSLIM,

136
00:05:58,592 --> 00:06:00,493
A MODEL IS A WHORE.

137
00:06:00,493 --> 00:06:03,296
Man:
THAT'S SEXY. RIGHT ON.

138
00:06:03,296 --> 00:06:06,032
Sara: MODELING IS NOT
THE JOB FOR A DAUGHTER.

139
00:06:06,032 --> 00:06:07,567
Laura: SARA'S RELATIONSHIP
WITH HER FATHER--

140
00:06:07,567 --> 00:06:09,369
I SEE IT AS--
IT'S UNFORTUNATE.

141
00:06:09,369 --> 00:06:11,605
THEY JUST HAVE NOT COME TO
AN AGREEMENT ON, YOU KNOW,

142
00:06:11,605 --> 00:06:13,540
HOW SHE SHOULD
LIVE HER LIFE.

143
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:15,008
OH, THESE WILL BE PRETTY.

144
00:06:15,008 --> 00:06:17,410
Sara: MY MOM RAISED ME
FROM WHEN I WAS

145
00:06:17,410 --> 00:06:20,013
JUST A LITTLE BABY
IN SEATTLE.

146
00:06:20,013 --> 00:06:21,014
SAME STORY
A LOT OF PEOPLE HAVE--

147
00:06:21,014 --> 00:06:23,283
SINGLE MOM-RAISED,
NOT A LOT OF MONEY.

148
00:06:23,283 --> 00:06:25,118
Laura: I HURT FOR SARA,
QUITE ACTUALLY,

149
00:06:25,118 --> 00:06:26,519
BECAUSE I THINK
SHE MISSED OUT,

150
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:28,255
YOU KNOW,
NOT HAVING A DAD.

151
00:06:28,255 --> 00:06:30,590
Sara: HE HAS
A DIFFERENT IDEOLOGY

152
00:06:30,590 --> 00:06:32,692
OF WHAT HE WANTS ME TO BE.

153
00:06:32,692 --> 00:06:35,295
I'M VERY PROUD OF
WHAT I AM, BUT AGAIN,

154
00:06:35,295 --> 00:06:37,330
THIS IS THE INDUSTRY
I LOVE.

155
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:42,102
Laura: SHE ALWAYS SAID,
"I WANNA MOVE TO NEW YORK.

156
00:06:42,102 --> 00:06:43,470
I WANNA BE
A HIGH FASHION MODEL."

157
00:06:43,470 --> 00:06:45,138
THEN SHE BECAME
VERY INTERESTED

158
00:06:45,138 --> 00:06:48,041
IN THE "SPORTS ILLUSTRATED"
SWIMSUIT EDITION.

159
00:06:48,041 --> 00:06:49,709
Sara: I STILL WALK INTO
ROOMS, AND I SEE MODELS

160
00:06:49,709 --> 00:06:53,146
WHO ARE, LIKE, SIZE 0, AND
I'M SITTIN' THERE WITH BOOBS

161
00:06:53,146 --> 00:06:54,981
AND, YOU KNOW,
I HAVE A SHAPE TO ME,

162
00:06:54,981 --> 00:06:56,249
AND I'M JUST LIKE,
OH, MY GOD.

163
00:06:58,485 --> 00:07:01,488
Tyra: I THINK THAT SARA
IS THE ONLY GIRL HERE

164
00:07:01,488 --> 00:07:05,725
THAT HAS THAT
SUPER TOP MODEL LOOK.

165
00:07:05,725 --> 00:07:07,761
SHE CAN STAND RIGHT NEXT
TO ME AND HEIDI

166
00:07:07,761 --> 00:07:10,664
IN A VICTORIA'S SECRET AD--
ALL OF US--AND FIT RIGHT IN.

167
00:07:10,664 --> 00:07:13,633
Eric: SARA, FOR ME,
I THINK JUST IS STARTING--

168
00:07:13,633 --> 00:07:14,734
I'M STARTING TO FEEL THAT
SHOULD COULD BE GOING

169
00:07:14,734 --> 00:07:19,306
WAY DOWN MARKET,
LIKE THE BEER COMMERCIALS.

170
00:07:19,306 --> 00:07:21,308
Tyra: YOANNA,
CONGRATULATIONS.

171
00:07:21,308 --> 00:07:24,477
Sara:
(sobbing)

172
00:07:24,477 --> 00:07:26,713
BEING ELIMINATED
WAS EXTREMELY HARD.

173
00:07:26,713 --> 00:07:28,615
IT REALLY DID HURT
THAT MUCH AND MORE

174
00:07:28,615 --> 00:07:29,983
THAN WHAT YOU SAW
ON THE SHOW.

175
00:07:31,718 --> 00:07:33,553
IT WAS A REALLY
EMOTIONAL EPISODE.

176
00:07:33,553 --> 00:07:34,487
IT REALLY WAS.

177
00:07:38,325 --> 00:07:40,460
TODAY I'M AT
THE "MAXIM" SHOOT.

178
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,461
THEY WANTED TO SHOOT ME,
I GUESS,

179
00:07:41,461 --> 00:07:43,563
BECAUSE OF THE WHOLE
"SEXY" THING ON THE SHOW,

180
00:07:43,563 --> 00:07:45,565
SO I'M DOING MY FIRST
PHOTO SHOOT

181
00:07:45,565 --> 00:07:47,267
HERE AT "MAXIM"
IN NEW YORK CITY.

182
00:07:49,235 --> 00:07:52,405
MY MAIN FOCUS IS MORE
OF THE LINGERIE/SWIMSUIT.

183
00:07:52,973 --> 00:07:55,275
THE OUTFITS ARE BARELY
EVEN CALLED OUTFITS.

184
00:07:55,275 --> 00:07:57,177
THEY'RE LIKE LITTLE
PIECES OF LINGERIE.

185
00:07:59,112 --> 00:08:00,747
I WANNA BE
IN "SPORTS ILLUSTRATED."

186
00:08:00,747 --> 00:08:03,550
PUT ME IN THERE!
NO. (laughs)

187
00:08:03,550 --> 00:08:05,385
IT'S BEEN MY DREAM
SINCE I WAS A LITTLE GIRL.

188
00:08:05,385 --> 00:08:06,619
I WILL ROCK IN IT.

189
00:08:09,089 --> 00:08:10,757
ROCK & REPUBLIC-- IT'S GONNA
BE MY FIRST RUNWAY SHOW

190
00:08:10,757 --> 00:08:13,093
SINCE "TOP MODEL"
STOPPED AIRING,

191
00:08:13,093 --> 00:08:15,028
AND I'M EXCITED.

192
00:08:15,028 --> 00:08:19,165
YOU KNOW, I HAD
TO WALK FOR THEM AND...

193
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:20,266
I'M JUST-- I'M EXCITED.

194
00:08:20,266 --> 00:08:21,668
I JUST WANNA BE ABLE
TO, YOU KNOW, KICK ASS

195
00:08:21,668 --> 00:08:23,036
AND HAVE PEOPLE
LOOK AT ME

196
00:08:23,036 --> 00:08:24,738
AND BE LIKE,
"OH, WE WANT HER AGAIN."

197
00:08:24,738 --> 00:08:27,607
Audience: (cheering)

198
00:08:27,607 --> 00:08:29,275
Tyra: SARA JUST SNAGGED
A MEETING

199
00:08:29,275 --> 00:08:31,244
WITH THE HEAD OF THE
"SPORTS ILLUSTRATED"

200
00:08:31,244 --> 00:08:34,447
SWIMSUIT EDITION, SO HER DREAM
JUST MAY COME TRUE.

201
00:08:35,749 --> 00:08:38,083
COMING UP: CAN I GET YOUR
AUTOGRAPH?
OF COURSE!

202
00:08:38,083 --> 00:08:41,988
HOMETOWN HEREO'S
WILLMAR'S OWN KATIE ANDERSON.

203
00:08:41,988 --> 00:08:45,091
AND FRIEND'S AND FAMILY
REUNITED.

204
00:08:45,091 --> 00:08:46,493
BRAVO!

205
00:08:46,493 --> 00:08:50,330
ON AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,
THE RUNWAY AHEAD.

206
00:09:01,041 --> 00:09:02,075
THERE IS A BIG DIFFERENCE

207
00:09:02,075 --> 00:09:05,178
BETWEEN BEING A MODEL
AND A TOP MODEL.

208
00:09:05,178 --> 00:09:06,413
A MODEL
IS A GIRL THAT WORKS.

209
00:09:06,413 --> 00:09:07,414
SHE DOES HER CATALOG.

210
00:09:07,414 --> 00:09:09,349
YOU KNOW, SHE MIGHT DO
SOME MAGAZINES

211
00:09:09,349 --> 00:09:11,251
EVERY NOW AND THEN,
BUT THE PUBLIC REALLY

212
00:09:11,251 --> 00:09:12,585
DOESN'T KNOW WHO SHE IS.

213
00:09:12,585 --> 00:09:14,287
THEY DON'T IDENTIFY
WITH HER.

214
00:09:14,287 --> 00:09:17,123
A TOP MODEL
IS A WHOLE PACKAGE.

215
00:09:17,123 --> 00:09:18,691
THERE'S PERSONALITY.

216
00:09:18,691 --> 00:09:19,993
THERE'S LOOKS.

217
00:09:19,993 --> 00:09:21,995
SHE HAS TO KNOW HOW
TO POSE HER BUTT OFF.

218
00:09:21,995 --> 00:09:23,063
SHE HAS TO KNOW
HOW TO DANCE.

219
00:09:23,063 --> 00:09:24,164
SHE HAS TO
KNOW HOW TO SPEAK.

220
00:09:24,164 --> 00:09:26,299
SHE HAS TO KNOW HOW TO
REPRESENT PRODUCTS,

221
00:09:26,299 --> 00:09:28,168
AND SHE HAS TO KNOW HOW
TO RELATE TO THE PUBLIC

222
00:09:28,168 --> 00:09:29,569
WHERE THEY LIKE HER.

223
00:09:29,569 --> 00:09:30,670
THEY WANNA BE HER FRIEND.

224
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:33,573
♪♪♪

225
00:09:33,573 --> 00:09:34,641
Tim: TIM & TODD,

226
00:09:34,641 --> 00:09:36,109
AND CATIE ANDERSON,

227
00:09:36,109 --> 00:09:39,245
WILLMAR'S OWN
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

228
00:09:39,245 --> 00:09:40,980
I CHECKED OUT UPN,

229
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:43,550
AND THIS IS THE PICTURE
THEY POST THERE.

230
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:46,052
I SAID TO TODD,
"NOW I DON'T THINK

231
00:09:46,052 --> 00:09:47,253
SHE'LL BE WEARING THAT
DOWNTOWN."

232
00:09:47,253 --> 00:09:48,521
Catie:
NO, DEFINITELY NOT.

233
00:09:50,123 --> 00:09:51,458
OHH!

234
00:09:51,458 --> 00:09:53,526
Tim: YOU MUST GET RECOGNIZED
EVERYWHERE YOU GO NOW.

235
00:09:53,526 --> 00:09:55,095
Catie: YEAH, IT'S--
OH, MY GOSH.

236
00:09:55,095 --> 00:09:56,029
IT'S WHAT I'VE ALWAYS WANTED.

237
00:09:57,730 --> 00:09:59,599
I WANNA BE A HOUSEHOLD NAME
WHERE PEOPLE--

238
00:09:59,599 --> 00:10:02,035
THEY SEE ME IN A PICTURE,
THEY GO, "OH, MY GOODNESS.

239
00:10:02,035 --> 00:10:03,203
THAT'S CATIE ANDERSON."

240
00:10:03,203 --> 00:10:04,237
Girl: CAN I GET
YOUR AUTOGRAPH?

241
00:10:04,237 --> 00:10:05,605
- Catie: OH, OF COURSE.
- Girl: THANK YOU.

242
00:10:05,605 --> 00:10:07,207
Girl #2: CAN I GET
YOUR AUTOGRAPH?

243
00:10:07,207 --> 00:10:08,208
Girl:
YOU WERE SO GOOD.

244
00:10:08,208 --> 00:10:09,509
Catie:
OH, THANK YOU.

245
00:10:09,509 --> 00:10:11,211
Woman: OH, MY GOSH!

246
00:10:11,211 --> 00:10:14,514
BOYS AND GIRLS, THIS IS
MY FRIEND CATIE ANDERSON,

247
00:10:14,514 --> 00:10:16,516
WHO WAS ON "TOP MODEL."

248
00:10:16,516 --> 00:10:18,184
Mark: AND I REMEMBER CATIE
WHEN SHE LEFT HERE.

249
00:10:18,184 --> 00:10:20,286
SHE TOLD US SHE WAS
GOING TO LOS ANGELES,

250
00:10:20,286 --> 00:10:21,654
AND LO AND BEHOLD,

251
00:10:21,654 --> 00:10:26,226
WE FIND OUT SHE MADE IT
BIG-TIME, SO...

252
00:10:26,226 --> 00:10:28,194
Catie: THIS REALLY ISN'T
MARILYN. IT'S ACTUALLY ME.

253
00:10:28,194 --> 00:10:30,530
YOU KNOW, IF THEY SAID,
"CATIE, TO MAKE IT,

254
00:10:30,530 --> 00:10:34,000
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE TO SHAVE
YOUR HEAD," MY HAIR'S GONE.

255
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,369
Edward: RIGHT NOW SHE DOESN'T
UNDERSTAND WHAT'S REALLY--

256
00:10:36,369 --> 00:10:38,638
Catie: NO, I DON'T UNDERSTAND
THE WHOLE CONCEPT.

257
00:10:38,638 --> 00:10:41,274
HELP ME.
HELP ME UNDERSTAND.

258
00:10:41,274 --> 00:10:44,010
I HAD EMOTIONAL ATTACHMENT
TO MY HAIR,

259
00:10:44,010 --> 00:10:46,212
SO I KINDA HAD
TO LET IT OUT.

260
00:10:46,212 --> 00:10:48,014
(crying)
I LOOK LIKE A BOY!

261
00:10:48,014 --> 00:10:50,316
I CRIED ABOUT MY HAIR.

262
00:10:50,316 --> 00:10:52,418
I CRIED
BECAUSE OF THE HEIGHTS.

263
00:10:52,418 --> 00:10:54,420
- (rattling)
- Catie: (gasps)

264
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:57,390
Jay: WE ARE GOING TO SUSPEND
YOU FROM THIS LEDGE

265
00:10:57,390 --> 00:11:00,426
AND SHOOT YOU GUYS
HANGING OVER THIS HOLE.

266
00:11:00,426 --> 00:11:02,362
Catie: I'M SORRY, BUT
ANYBODY WHO HAS A PHOBIA

267
00:11:02,362 --> 00:11:04,030
WOULD UNDERSTAND.

268
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,031
Jay: DO YOU WANNA
COME UP, CATIE?

269
00:11:05,031 --> 00:11:07,700
- Catie: GIVE ME A SECOND.
- Jay: OKAY.

270
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:10,403
Catie: I'M THINKING, "SUCK IT UP
AND GET IT OVER WITH.

271
00:11:10,403 --> 00:11:11,604
YOU HAVE TO DO THIS.

272
00:11:11,604 --> 00:11:14,174
YOU'RE OUT HERE. YOU
MIGHT AS WELL DO YOUR BEST.

273
00:11:14,174 --> 00:11:16,509
Jay: BEAUTIFUL.
I LOVE IT.

274
00:11:16,509 --> 00:11:17,577
DO YOU KNOW WHAT, CATIE?

275
00:11:17,577 --> 00:11:19,612
WE GOT IT.
YOU'RE DONE.

276
00:11:19,612 --> 00:11:23,016
Catie: I'VE ALWAYS BEEN
VERY OPEN ABOUT MY DREAM.

277
00:11:23,016 --> 00:11:25,418
SINCE I WAS 13,
I'VE WANTED TO MODEL.

278
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:28,755
MY DAD MEANS
SO MUCH TO ME.

279
00:11:28,755 --> 00:11:31,457
Mary: SHE'S DEFINITELY
DADDY'S LITTLE GIRL.

280
00:11:31,457 --> 00:11:33,293
Ted: SHE'S MATURED A LOT,
YOU KNOW, LIVING ON HER OWN,

281
00:11:33,293 --> 00:11:35,361
AND I THINK THAT
THERE'S A GREAT DEAL

282
00:11:35,361 --> 00:11:37,597
OF PERSONAL GROWTH THAT COMES
ALONG WITH DOING THAT.

283
00:11:37,597 --> 00:11:39,566
Catie: HE'S MY DADDY,
YOU KNOW?

284
00:11:39,566 --> 00:11:42,235
I WANT HIM--I WANT HIM
TO BE HAPPY AND PROUD OF ME.

285
00:11:42,235 --> 00:11:44,604
I HAVE THE BEST FAMILY
IN THE WORLD.

286
00:11:44,604 --> 00:11:46,239
THEY ARE
ABSOLUTELY MY CORE.

287
00:11:47,607 --> 00:11:49,976
Ted: FIRST COUPLE OF EPISODES
WERE FUN TO WATCH.

288
00:11:49,976 --> 00:11:51,477
J.: SHAKE.
SHAKE YOUR BODY.

289
00:11:51,477 --> 00:11:54,380
THIS GIRL CATIE, I THINK,
MAYBE SHE COULD BE A MODEL.

290
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,516
Ted: UM, AFTER THAT,
SOMETIMES THEY GOT

291
00:11:56,516 --> 00:11:58,251
A LITTLE BIT
TOUGHER TO WATCH.

292
00:11:58,251 --> 00:12:00,320
Simon: I THINK THERE'S
A LITTLE TOO MUCH HOOKER STYLE

293
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,322
GOING ON WITH THE LEG WARMERS
WITH THE HIGH HEELS.

294
00:12:02,322 --> 00:12:06,259
Catie: I WAS GOING
DOWNHILL FAST.

295
00:12:06,259 --> 00:12:08,561
I WAS GOING DOWNHILL.
(laughing)

296
00:12:08,561 --> 00:12:10,997
Eric: SHE'S KIND OF
THE GIRL NEXT DOOR.

297
00:12:10,997 --> 00:12:12,432
BUT I THINK
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL

298
00:12:12,432 --> 00:12:15,235
HAS TO BE LIKE THE GIRL,
LIKE, WAY OVER THERE.

299
00:12:17,437 --> 00:12:21,274
Tyra: CATIE, SOMETIMES
THE JUDGES FEEL LIKE YOU ARE

300
00:12:21,274 --> 00:12:25,311
A LITTLE BIT TOO COMMERCIAL,
A LITTLE BIT TOO SAFE.

301
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,482
CAMILLE.

302
00:12:29,482 --> 00:12:31,384
Catie:
I DON'T FEEL REJECTED.

303
00:12:31,384 --> 00:12:34,153
I'M JUST DISAPPOINTED
IN MYSELF.

304
00:12:34,153 --> 00:12:35,989
(crying)
THANKS, GUYS.

305
00:12:35,989 --> 00:12:38,491
I GOT MY ASS KICKED OFF
THE SHOW.

306
00:12:38,491 --> 00:12:41,394
(sighs)
GO BACK TO L.A.,

307
00:12:41,394 --> 00:12:45,732
WORK MY ASS OFF, AND
GET TO THE TOP ON MY OWN.

308
00:12:47,533 --> 00:12:49,168
IT DIDN'T HIT ME UNTIL, LIKE,
TWO WEEKS AFTERWARDS,

309
00:12:49,168 --> 00:12:51,537
AND I'M LIKE,
"OH, I'M NOT ON THE SHOW.

310
00:12:51,537 --> 00:12:54,173
THIS REALLY SUCKS."

311
00:12:56,542 --> 00:12:59,612
WELL, I WOULD LOVE
TO OBVIOUSLY MODEL, ACT...

312
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:01,581
Man: ACTION.

313
00:13:01,581 --> 00:13:05,084
Catie: AND I WOULD LOVE
TO DO TV HOSTING.

314
00:13:05,084 --> 00:13:08,755
I'M REALLY TRYING TO CAPITALIZE
ON THE MOMENT THAT I HAVE.

315
00:13:08,755 --> 00:13:11,224
'CAUSE I GOT
THIS GREAT EXPOSURE.

316
00:13:11,224 --> 00:13:13,326
NOW IS LIKE THE REAL
COMPETITION.

317
00:13:13,326 --> 00:13:14,661
THAT WAS JUST A WARM-UP.

318
00:13:14,661 --> 00:13:16,996
THE SHOW WAS COMPLETELY
JUST A WARM-UP.

319
00:13:16,996 --> 00:13:19,465
♪♪♪

320
00:13:21,534 --> 00:13:24,237
Anna: YOU KNOW, I LEFT
MY HUSBAND AND MY SON.

321
00:13:24,237 --> 00:13:25,038
Xiomara:
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?

322
00:13:25,038 --> 00:13:26,506
YOUR HUSBAND?

323
00:13:26,506 --> 00:13:28,241
HOW OLD IS YOUR SON?

324
00:13:28,241 --> 00:13:29,642
Anna:
HE'S 2.

325
00:13:29,642 --> 00:13:31,311
THE GIRLS WERE SAYING,
"OH, YOU'RE A MOM.

326
00:13:31,311 --> 00:13:33,112
YOU KNOW,
YOU MUST MISS YOUR SON.

327
00:13:33,112 --> 00:13:34,247
YOU MUST MISS
YOUR HUSBAND."

328
00:13:34,247 --> 00:13:35,615
I WAS LIKE,
"YES, I DO MISS THEM."

329
00:13:35,615 --> 00:13:37,283
Makarious:
I miss you, Mama.

330
00:13:37,283 --> 00:13:38,718
Anna:
I LOVE YOU.

331
00:13:38,718 --> 00:13:40,019
Makarious:
I love you.

332
00:13:40,019 --> 00:13:42,188
Anna: I DIDN'T VIEW THAT
AS A HINDRANCE OF ANY TYPE

333
00:13:42,188 --> 00:13:44,123
TOWARD ME OR MY CAREER.

334
00:13:44,123 --> 00:13:45,491
Catie: WHAT DOES YOUR HUSBAND
THINK OF YOU BEING HERE?

335
00:13:45,491 --> 00:13:46,492
Xiomara: MM-HMM.

336
00:13:46,492 --> 00:13:48,394
Anna: OH,
HE SUPPORTS ME 100%.

337
00:13:48,394 --> 00:13:49,329
Jermaine:
EVERYBODY HAVE A DREAM,

338
00:13:49,329 --> 00:13:50,997
AND I KNEW MODELING
WAS HER DREAM.

339
00:13:50,997 --> 00:13:53,700
Anna: IT'S IN ME,
AND I JUST HAVE TO DO IT.

340
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:55,435
Ed: THIS IS THE MAJOR PART
OF YOUR COSTUME RIGHT HERE.

341
00:13:55,435 --> 00:13:57,503
Anna: I KNEW THAT
THERE MAY BE A CHANCE

342
00:13:57,503 --> 00:14:00,139
THAT I WAS GONNA BE ASKED
TO POSE NUDE.

343
00:14:00,139 --> 00:14:02,308
I WAS HOPING
THERE WOULDN'T BE.

344
00:14:03,076 --> 00:14:04,610
Nigel:
YOU ARE GONNA BE NUDE.

345
00:14:04,610 --> 00:14:06,979
Anna: I SAT THERE IN THE ROOM,
AND I SAW THESE GIRLS.

346
00:14:06,979 --> 00:14:08,681
THEIR COOCHIE WAS SHOWING.

347
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:10,450
Jermaine: OH, BABY, YOU CAN'T
SAY THAT ON TELEVISION.

348
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:12,018
Anna: THEIR BREASTS
WERE HANGING OUT

349
00:14:12,018 --> 00:14:12,752
AND NIPPLES SHOWIN'.

350
00:14:14,721 --> 00:14:16,456
I DON'T WANNA BE
A PART OF THAT.

351
00:14:16,456 --> 00:14:18,658
I CAN'T JUST IMAGINE
SOMEONE ELSE HERE

352
00:14:18,658 --> 00:14:21,461
AND DOWN THERE
EXCEPT MY HUSBAND.

353
00:14:21,461 --> 00:14:22,528
Jermaine SHE REALLY
BLEW ME AWAY

354
00:14:22,528 --> 00:14:24,163
BY HER SAYING THEM THINGS

355
00:14:24,163 --> 00:14:27,266
AND STANDING UP
FOR WHAT SHE BELIEVE IN.

356
00:14:27,266 --> 00:14:29,001
Nigel: I'M SORRY, BUT I'M GOING
TO HAVE TO ASK YOU TO LEAVE.

357
00:14:29,001 --> 00:14:30,403
I'M SORRY.

358
00:14:30,403 --> 00:14:32,672
Tyra: THE JUDGES
WERE QUITE DISAPPOINTED

359
00:14:32,672 --> 00:14:35,241
THAT YOU DIDN'T DO
THE PHOTO SHOOT,

360
00:14:35,241 --> 00:14:37,043
BUT YOU FELT
A CERTAIN RESPONSIBILITY

361
00:14:37,043 --> 00:14:39,612
AS A WIFE AND A MOM,
AND WE RESPECT THAT.

362
00:14:39,612 --> 00:14:40,613
THANK YOU, ANNA.

363
00:14:40,613 --> 00:14:43,015
- Anna: THANK YOU, TYRA.
- Xiomara: BYE, MOMMY.

364
00:14:43,015 --> 00:14:44,650
Catie: ANNA--YOU KNOW,

365
00:14:44,650 --> 00:14:46,285
SHE'S IN A DIFFERENT PLACE
IN HER LIFE.

366
00:14:46,285 --> 00:14:47,587
SHE HAS A SON,
AND SHE HAS A HUSBAND.

367
00:14:50,456 --> 00:14:53,159
Makarious: (laughing)

368
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:55,128
Anna: I DON'T REGRET
ANY DECISIONS I MADE

369
00:14:55,128 --> 00:14:57,397
OR ANYTHING THAT
HAPPENED ON THE SHOW.

370
00:14:57,397 --> 00:14:58,698
I THINK IT WAS A GREAT
EXPERIENCE FOR ME.

371
00:15:00,266 --> 00:15:03,136
GETTING ME OUT THERE--
IT'S EXPOSING ME.

372
00:15:03,136 --> 00:15:04,971
WHEN I DO STEP INTO
MODELING FULL-TIME,

373
00:15:04,971 --> 00:15:08,241
I DO EXPECT TO HAVE MY SON
ON SET WITH ME.

374
00:15:08,241 --> 00:15:10,443
I DO EXPECT
TO HAVE MY HUSBAND.

375
00:15:10,443 --> 00:15:13,112
I WANTED TO BE ABLE TO WORK
BETTER IN THIS BUSINESS

376
00:15:13,112 --> 00:15:14,347
AND WORK ON MY CAREER,

377
00:15:14,347 --> 00:15:17,016
SO I HAVE GOTTEN
DOWN TO A SIZE 6.

378
00:15:17,016 --> 00:15:20,653
I CALLED SOME AGENCIES
AND GOT A CONTRACT.

379
00:15:20,653 --> 00:15:24,490
I'M LOOKING OVER IT,
AND HOPEFULLY I CAN QUIT

380
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:29,195
MY 9-TO-5 JOB AND START
MODELING FULL-TIME.

381
00:15:29,195 --> 00:15:31,097
I'M ON MY WAY UP.

382
00:15:31,464 --> 00:15:34,233
♪♪♪

383
00:15:34,233 --> 00:15:35,601
Shandi: SHANDI'S LIFE

384
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:38,037
WILL NEVER BE THE SAME
AFTER "TOP MODEL."

385
00:15:38,037 --> 00:15:41,040
I'M CHANGING EVERYTHING ABOUT
MYSELF BECAUSE OF THE SHOW,

386
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,309
WHICH I AM
VERY GRATEFUL FOR.

387
00:15:43,309 --> 00:15:44,277
IT'S NICE TO WAKE UP
IN THE MORNING

388
00:15:44,277 --> 00:15:47,146
AND THINK
THAT YOU'RE BEAUTIFUL.

389
00:15:47,146 --> 00:15:48,748
MY MOM ALWAYS THOUGHT
THAT I LOOKED LIKE A BOY.

390
00:15:48,748 --> 00:15:49,749
PEOPLE CONSTANTLY TOLD ME,

391
00:15:49,749 --> 00:15:51,184
"YOU'RE NEVER GONNA
GET MARRIED."

392
00:15:52,585 --> 00:15:54,554
I AM FROM
KANSAS CITY, MISSOURI.

393
00:15:54,554 --> 00:15:57,390
I WORK AT A WALGREENS.
I'M A SERVICE CLERK.

394
00:15:57,390 --> 00:15:59,292
IT'S $20.28.

395
00:15:59,292 --> 00:16:01,627
ONE OF THE MAIN REASONS
I WENT DOWN TO THE AUDITION

396
00:16:01,627 --> 00:16:04,297
WAS THE FACT THAT, YOU KNOW,
I HAD NOTHING TO LOSE.

397
00:16:06,499 --> 00:16:10,570
WHEN I FIRST SAW
ALL THE GIRLS...

398
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:12,705
I THINK ONE OF MY FIRST
THOUGHTS WAS, "OH, OKAY,

399
00:16:12,705 --> 00:16:14,440
I GUESS--
WHAT AM I DOING HERE?

400
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,342
'CAUSE THESE GIRLS ARE
REALLY, REALLY PRETTY."

401
00:16:16,342 --> 00:16:17,977
Bethany: SHANDI--
I DON'T KNOW.

402
00:16:17,977 --> 00:16:19,479
EVEN THOUGH SHE'S
VERY TALL AND THIN,

403
00:16:19,479 --> 00:16:21,280
I JUST DON'T SEE IT.

404
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,381
HER EYES ARE
VERY CLOSE TOGETHER.

405
00:16:22,381 --> 00:16:23,316
SHE KINDA REMINDS ME
OF A BIRD.

406
00:16:25,618 --> 00:16:27,420
Shandi: TO COMPETE
AGAINST THESE OTHER GIRLS,

407
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:29,088
I'M GONNA NEED
TO DO BETTER.

408
00:16:29,088 --> 00:16:30,523
I NEED TO TRY HARDER.

409
00:16:30,523 --> 00:16:32,391
Eric: THERE'S
A BEAUTIFUL GIRL THERE.

410
00:16:32,391 --> 00:16:34,393
NOT EVERYBODY CAN SEE THAT,
THOUGH.

411
00:16:35,428 --> 00:16:38,397
Tyra: MISS SHANDI
WITH THAT BROWN HAIR,

412
00:16:38,397 --> 00:16:42,335
WE ARE GOING TO MAKE YOU
A PLATINUM BLONDE.

413
00:16:42,335 --> 00:16:43,436
Shandi: EVERYTHING'S
COME TOGETHER.

414
00:16:43,436 --> 00:16:45,371
I FEEL SO PRETTY
RIGHT NOW.

415
00:16:48,241 --> 00:16:50,276
Janice: THIS GIRL IS
A SUPERMODEL IN THE MAKING.

416
00:16:50,276 --> 00:16:52,211
- Shandi: WHOA.
- Eric: WOW!

417
00:16:52,211 --> 00:16:53,613
Shandi: IT STARTED
TO MAKE ME BELIEVE

418
00:16:53,613 --> 00:16:54,614
THAT I BELONGED THERE.

419
00:16:56,682 --> 00:16:58,251
Tyra: ♪ BACK YOUR BAGS ♪
♪ Y'ALL ♪

420
00:16:58,251 --> 00:17:00,186
- ♪ YOU'RE GOING TO MILAN! ♪♪
- Women: (screaming)

421
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,523
Shandi: MILAN, FOR ME,
IS, LIKE, UNBELIEVABLE.

422
00:17:03,523 --> 00:17:06,259
EVERYTHING IS JUST
A MILLION TIMES NICER.

423
00:17:09,060 --> 00:17:11,263
I MISS MY BOYFRIEND.

424
00:17:11,263 --> 00:17:13,699
I REALLY WISH HE COULD HAVE
EXPERIENCED THIS WITH ME.

425
00:17:13,699 --> 00:17:15,601
- Men: CIAO.
- Women: CIAO.

426
00:17:15,601 --> 00:17:17,703
April: YOANNA CALLS
THE REALLY CUTE ONE,

427
00:17:17,703 --> 00:17:19,372
AND HE SAYS HE'LL COME AND
BRING SOME FRIENDS.

428
00:17:19,372 --> 00:17:21,107
- Men: HI.
- Women: HI.

429
00:17:21,107 --> 00:17:22,308
Mercedes: TO LIFE.

430
00:17:22,308 --> 00:17:24,175
Women: AAH! (laughing)

431
00:17:24,175 --> 00:17:26,412
Shandi: JUST CAUGHT UP IN,
LIKE, THE SEXUAL TENSION,

432
00:17:26,412 --> 00:17:28,281
HAVING REALLY
GOOD-LOOKING GUYS COME OVER.

433
00:17:28,281 --> 00:17:30,283
April: DING!
HOLD ON A SECOND, SHANDI.

434
00:17:30,283 --> 00:17:31,317
YOU'VE GOT A BOYFRIEND.

435
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:35,688
- Eric: Hey.
- Shandi: HI.

436
00:17:35,688 --> 00:17:38,190
- Eric: How are you doin'?
- Shandi: NOT SO GOOD.

437
00:17:38,190 --> 00:17:41,594
THINK OF THE WORST
POSSIBLE THING I COULD DO.

438
00:17:41,594 --> 00:17:44,330
Eric: (shrieking)
You had sex?!

439
00:17:44,330 --> 00:17:45,665
Shandi: YEAH.

440
00:17:45,665 --> 00:17:47,567
Eric: I can't be with someone
that cheated on me.

441
00:17:47,567 --> 00:17:50,202
Shandi: (sobbing)

442
00:17:53,673 --> 00:17:55,575
Shandi: IT WAS ONE
OF THE TIMES OF MY LIFE

443
00:17:55,575 --> 00:17:58,311
WHERE I FELT THE WORST ABOUT
SOMETHING THAT I DID.

444
00:17:58,311 --> 00:18:00,112
I'VE NEVER
FELT SO HORRIBLE.

445
00:18:00,112 --> 00:18:02,515
I JUST HAD NO DESIRE
TO BE THERE,

446
00:18:02,515 --> 00:18:05,318
AND THE JUDGES
COULD SEE THAT, TOO.

447
00:18:05,318 --> 00:18:08,588
Tyra: I WILL ONLY
CALL ONE NAME.

448
00:18:08,588 --> 00:18:10,256
YOANNA.

449
00:18:10,256 --> 00:18:11,591
THANKS, SHANDI.

450
00:18:11,591 --> 00:18:13,559
Shandi: IT WAS HARD
TO EVEN TRY TO REMEMBER

451
00:18:13,559 --> 00:18:14,594
HOW I USED TO BE.

452
00:18:14,594 --> 00:18:16,295
I'VE GROWN MORE IN, LIKE,
THE PAST COUPLE WEEKS

453
00:18:16,295 --> 00:18:18,631
THAN I'VE GROWN, LIKE,
IN THE PAST COUPLE YEARS.

454
00:18:18,631 --> 00:18:21,300
WHEN I GET HOME,
I WON'T FEEL SO LOST.

455
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:25,471
I WON'T FEEL SO...
INSECURE ABOUT MYSELF.

456
00:18:25,471 --> 00:18:27,540
AFTER THE SHOW, I HAD TO
GO BACK TO WALGREENS.

457
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:29,575
Woman: OH, WERE YOU
THE ONE THAT WENT--WERE--

458
00:18:29,575 --> 00:18:31,043
- WAS ON THAT MODELING THING?
- Shandi: MM-HMM.

459
00:18:31,043 --> 00:18:32,244
Woman: OH.

460
00:18:32,244 --> 00:18:33,279
Shandi: BUT IT'S JUST
FOR THE TIME BEING.

461
00:18:33,279 --> 00:18:35,481
IT'S NOT A PERMANENT THING.

462
00:18:35,481 --> 00:18:37,383
- Eric: THERE YOU GO.
- Shandi: THANK YOU.

463
00:18:37,383 --> 00:18:39,251
MY BOYFRIEND AND I--
WE'RE STILL HAVING PROBLEMS

464
00:18:39,251 --> 00:18:40,987
WITH THE TRUST ISSUE.

465
00:18:40,987 --> 00:18:41,988
Eric:
WHAT SHE DID WAS WRONG,

466
00:18:41,988 --> 00:18:44,090
BUT I HAVE BEEN ABLE
TO FORGIVE HER.

467
00:18:44,090 --> 00:18:45,291
Shandi:
WE'RE GONNA MAKE IT WORK.

468
00:18:47,293 --> 00:18:49,729
(kisses) I LOVE YOU, MOM.

469
00:18:49,729 --> 00:18:52,264
I THINK THE SHOW
HAD A LOT TO DO WITH, UM,

470
00:18:52,264 --> 00:18:54,567
I DON'T NECESSARILY FEEL
CLOSER TO MY MOM,

471
00:18:54,567 --> 00:18:58,704
BUT I FEEL LIKE A LOT OF, UM,
MY FEELINGS HAVE BEEN RESOLVED,

472
00:18:58,704 --> 00:19:02,041
WHICH HELPS ME WANT
TO BE CLOSER TO MY MOM.

473
00:19:02,041 --> 00:19:04,410
Vivian:
I'M VERY PROUD OF SHANDI.

474
00:19:04,410 --> 00:19:07,113
I NEVER IN MY WILDEST
DREAMS THOUGHT

475
00:19:07,113 --> 00:19:08,714
THIS WOULD EVER HAPPEN
TO ONE OF MY GIRLS.

476
00:19:08,714 --> 00:19:10,182
Shandi:
I'M GOING TO NEW YORK,

477
00:19:10,182 --> 00:19:12,418
AND I'M GONNA MEET
WITH EIGHT AGENCIES.

478
00:19:12,418 --> 00:19:13,519
- Vivian: EIGHT?
- Shandi: EIGHT.

479
00:19:13,519 --> 00:19:15,454
Vivian:
SHE DIDN'T TELL ME EIGHT.

480
00:19:15,454 --> 00:19:17,323
Shandi: ALL THESE
THINGS ARE HAPPENING

481
00:19:17,323 --> 00:19:19,392
LIKE THESE INTERVIEWS
AND GETTING READY

482
00:19:19,392 --> 00:19:20,593
TO DO PHOTO SHOOTS
FOR MAGAZINES.

483
00:19:20,593 --> 00:19:23,729
I'M TRYING TO SAVE UP MONEY
TO MOVE TO NEW YORK

484
00:19:23,729 --> 00:19:26,465
AND GET MY CAREER GOIN'.

485
00:19:26,465 --> 00:19:28,267
BEING ON THE SHOW
MADE ME REALIZE, YOU KNOW,

486
00:19:28,267 --> 00:19:30,703
THIS IS WHAT I WANNA DO.

487
00:19:30,703 --> 00:19:35,274
IT'S GIVEN ME THE DETERMINATION
TO NOT TRY AND WORRY ABOUT

488
00:19:35,274 --> 00:19:36,542
WHETHER OR NOT
I'M GONNA MAKE IT,

489
00:19:36,542 --> 00:19:37,510
JUST TO AT LEAST TRY.

490
00:19:42,281 --> 00:19:44,283
Tyra: SHANDI'S SHOOTING
A BIG MAGAZINE SPREAD

491
00:19:44,283 --> 00:19:46,085
IN "GLAMOUR" AND "CosmoGIRL!"

492
00:19:46,085 --> 00:19:50,022
♪♪♪

493
00:19:50,022 --> 00:19:51,257
