PUT ME IN THAT CATEGORY--

496
00:19:55,394 --> 00:19:57,430
'CAUSE I'M BLONDE
AND HAVE BIGGER BOOBS,

497
00:19:57,430 --> 00:19:59,665
BUT I HAVE A LOT MORE TALENT
THAN THE BOOBS.

498
00:19:59,665 --> 00:20:02,401
Eric: I'M NOT SO SURE
