IS VERY SEXY.

501
00:20:07,339 --> 00:20:09,408
YOU HAVE TO BE VERY
CONSCIOUS OF HOW YOU POSE,

502
00:20:09,408 --> 00:20:11,043
'CAUSE IT'LL TAKE YOU AWAY
FROM FASHION.

503
00:20:12,578 --> 00:20:16,082
Xiomara: BETHANY'S BODY
IS MORE VOLUPTUOUS.

504
00:20:16,082 --> 00:20:18,451
Bethany: WELL, OBVIOUSLY,
I KNOW THAT I DON'T HAVE

505
00:20:18,451 --> 00:20:20,553
A STICK-THIN FIGURE.

506
00:20:20,553 --> 00:20:22,655
