STOP LOOKING AT MY BOOBS

507
00:20:22,655 --> 00:20:23,689
AND START
LOOKING AT SOME TALENT.

508
00:20:23,689 --> 00:20:24,724
I WANT SOMETHING
TO WORK ON.

509
00:20:24,724 --> 00:20:25,758
I CAN'T DO
ANYTHING ABOUT MY CHEST.

510
00:20:25,758 --> 00:20:27,593
Tyra: YES, YOU CAN.

511
00:20:27,593 --> 00:20:29,395
YOU CAN POSE DIFFERENTLY.

512
00:20:29,395 --> 00:20:32,031
YOU'RE NOT THE ONLY MODEL
THAT HAS A BIG CHEST.

513
00:20:32,531 --> 00:20:34,467
YOU'RE HERE BECAUSE
YOU WANNA BE A FASHION MODEL.

514
00:20:34,467 --> 00:20:36,202
Bethany: WHAT CAN I DO?
BUT IT'S JUST--

515
00:20:36,202 --> 00:20:37,603
Tyra: YOU'RE HERE.

516
00:20:37,603 --> 00:20:40,172
SO YOU HAVE TO LEARN
TO WORK IN THIS WORLD.

517
00:20:42,541 --> 00:20:44,376
Bethany: I DEFINITELY
DIDN'T THINK

518
00:20:44,376 --> 00:20:47,179
I WAS GONNA GO
THIS SOON, IF AT ALL.

519
00:20:47,179 --> 00:20:48,380
I KNOW THAT I HAVE
A LOT MORE TALENT

520
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:51,383
THAN PROBABLY HALF
THESE GIRLS HERE.

521
00:20:51,383 --> 00:20:53,753
IT'S VERY FRUSTRATING
TO ME.

522
00:20:53,753 --> 00:20:56,288
Woman: SO WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE
TO SEE HAPPEN IN YOUR LIFE?

523
00:20:56,288 --> 00:20:58,057
Bethany: WELL, HOPEFULLY,
GET SOME MODELING JOBS.

524
00:20:58,057 --> 00:21:00,760
I'M THINKING ABOUT
MOVIN OUT HERE TO L.A., UM,

525
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:02,728
PROBABLY IN A MONTH OR TWO
