526
00:21:02,728 --> 00:21:05,064
HARD PURSUING IT,
SO WE'LL SEE WHAT HAPPENS.

527
00:21:06,031 --> 00:21:09,668
LATER IN THE SHOW YVONNA'S
FIRST DAY AS AMERICA'S NEXT TOP
MODEL.

528
00:21:09,668 --> 00:21:12,037
IT'S INSANE. IT'S LIKE A DREAM
COME TRUE.

529
00:21:12,037 --> 00:21:15,007
AND UP NEXT, APRIL'S FIRST
PROFESSIONAL PHOTOSHOOT.

530
00:21:15,007 --> 00:21:16,709
MONEY. THAT'S IT. RIGHT THERE.

531
00:21:28,387 --> 00:21:30,256
Tyra: A LOT OF TIMES,
PEOPLE WILL WATCH THE SHOW

532
00:21:30,256 --> 00:21:32,258
AND GO, "WHY IS THAT GIRL
