538
00:21:41,567 --> 00:21:44,970
THAT MAKES THE PUBLIC
CURIOUS ABOUT THAT GIRL.

539
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:47,106
SO THAT'S WHAT I'M
LOOKING FOR-- JUST SPUNK.

540
00:21:47,106 --> 00:21:50,109
♪♪♪

541
00:21:50,109 --> 00:21:51,610
Jenascia: WHAT'S UP, PEOPLE?
I'M JENASCIA.

542
00:21:51,610 --> 00:21:53,245
I'M BACK IN
