00:22:08,227 --> 00:22:10,196
NO? GOOD.

551
00:22:10,196 --> 00:22:12,498
'CAUSE I DIDN'T WANNA
GET IT ANYWAY.

552
00:22:12,498 --> 00:22:15,100
THERE'S YOUR GUYS'
ENTERTAINMENT FOR THE DAY.

553
00:22:15,100 --> 00:22:16,569
I'M GOING TO BE DOING
MY CROSSWORD PUZZLE.

554
00:22:16,569 --> 00:22:17,703
ENJOY.

555
00:22:19,405 --> 00:22:20,406
I'M JENASCIA.

556
00:22:20,406 --> 00:22:22,141
THE FACT THAT I GOT
CHOSEN FOR THE SHOW

557
00:22:22,141 --> 00:22:24,310
WAS A BIG SHOCK FOR ME.

558
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:26,245
AND I'M SHORT!

559
00:22:26,245 --> 00:22:28,981
I KNEW THAT I WAS THE SHORTEST
FROM THE VERY BEGINNING

560
00:22:28,981 --> 00:22:30,316
OUT OF ALL THE GIRLS.

561
00:22:30,316 --> 00:22:32,518
AND I WAS THINKIN' THAT,
YOU KNOW, I'LL JUST WEAR HEELS

562
00:22:32,518 --> 00:22:38,190
THE ENTIRE TIME I'M HERE,
BUT... (bleep) IT.

563
00:22:38,190 --> 00:22:40,226
Janice: SHORT.
SHE'S TOO SHORT. LET'S FACE IT.

564
00:22:40,226 --> 00:22:41,493
Eric: 5'7"?

565
00:22:41,493 --> 00:22:43,996
Janice: FOR 5'7",
YOU HAVE TO THINK TALL,

566
00:22:43,996 --> 00:22:45,297
BECAUSE IF YOU THINK TALL,
YOU WILL BE TALL.

567
00:22:45,297 --> 00:22:47,132
SO JUST TRY
