568
00:22:47,132 --> 00:22:48,567
Tyra: I LIKE THAT
JENASCIA IS SHORT.

569
00:22:48,567 --> 00:22:50,436
I THINK IT'S SPECIAL.
IT MAKES YOU STAND OUT.

570
00:22:50,436 --> 00:22:51,971
Jenascia:
I'M NOT SHORT!

571
00:22:51,971 --> 00:22:53,539
BUT I ABSOLUTELY REFUSE
TO WALK AROUND IN HEELS

572
00:22:53,539 --> 00:22:54,673
FOR THE REST OF MY LIFE.

573
00:22:54,673 --> 00:22:58,077
Tyra: JENASCIA, YOUR HAIR IS
