574
00:22:58,077 --> 00:23:00,079
Jenascia: THEY PLAYED
THE TALL CARD WITH ME AGAIN.

575
00:23:00,079 --> 00:23:01,680
THIS SKIRT MAKES MY LEGS
LOOK A LITTLE BIT LONGER,

576
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:03,215
WHICH IS IMPORTANT.

577
00:23:03,215 --> 00:23:05,184
Tyra: I'M NOT LOOKING AT YOU
HERE TO BE TALLER.

578
00:23:05,184 --> 00:23:07,219
I'M LOOKING AT YOU
HERE TO REPRESENT 5'7".

579
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:09,421
I'VE GOTTA GET OVER THIS
