581
00:23:12,424 --> 00:23:15,527
AND, YOU KNOW,
TAKE SOME VITAMINS ALL I WANT,

582
00:23:15,527 --> 00:23:17,229
BUT I'M NOT GETTING
ANY TALLER.

583
00:23:17,229 --> 00:23:19,365
Janice: LET'S FACE IT.
COUTURE IS TALL, THIN.

584
00:23:19,365 --> 00:23:21,267
Jenascia: HOW THE HELL--
FREAK DO YOU SAY THAT WORD?

585
00:23:21,267 --> 00:23:22,301
HOT COUTURE?

586
00:23:22,301 --> 00:23:24,270
HOTE... HAUTE COUTURE.

587
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:25,638
BLEHH.

588
00:23:25,638 --> 00:23:27,539
I'VE HEARD A FEW TIMES,
YOU KNOW, "YOU'RE SHORT.

589
00:23:27,539 --> 00:23:29,341
YOU'RE SHORT.
