642
00:25:28,427 --> 00:25:30,596
TO DISCOVER HOW MUCH
I DID REALLY ENJOY

643
00:25:30,596 --> 00:25:33,265
WORKING
IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA.

644
00:25:33,265 --> 00:25:36,535
Nolé: APRIL IS LIKE "CROUCHING
TIGER, HIDDEN DRAGON,"

645
00:25:36,535 --> 00:25:38,704
"THE MATRIX."
SHE WAS FABULOUS.

646
00:25:40,572 --> 00:25:43,008
Janice: APRIL,
YOU'VE GOT THIS NEGATIVITY

647
00:25:43,008 --> 00:25:44,710
TOWARDS YOUR ETHNICITY.

648
00:25:44,710 --> 00:25:48,580
SHE CLEARLY LOOKS ASIAN,
