654
00:26:01,126 --> 00:26:03,529
AT THE MOMENT, OR, CAMILLE,
OR, YOU KNOW, XIOMARA,

655
00:26:03,529 --> 00:26:05,364
YOU GUYS ARE THE TOP BLACK
OR LATIN GIRLS.

656
00:26:05,364 --> 00:26:06,565
April: I'M A MUTT.

657
00:26:06,565 --> 00:26:08,200
I'M A MUTT LOUD AND PROUD,
YOU KNOW?

658
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:11,703
I'M HALF JAPANESE, GERMAN,
IRISH, SCOTTISH AND WELSH.

659
00:26:15,541 --> 00:26:20,646
I THINK BASICALLY THE JUDGES
MISREAD MY NERVOUSNESS

660
00:26:20,646 --> 00:26:23,115
AS RIGIDNESS,

661
00:26:23,115 --> 00:26:27,019
AND MAYBE MY TIMIDNESS
AS COCKINESS.

662
00:26:27,019 --> 00:26:28,687
Nigel: SHE'S CLINICAL.
SHE'S LIKE A TECHNICIAN.

663
00:26:28,687 --> 00:26:30,022
Stephen:
SHE THINKS TOO MUCH.

664
00:26:30,022 --> 00:26:32,057
SHE'S TRYING
TO DEPICT A MODEL

665
00:26:32,057 --> 00:26:33,625
HOW SHE'S SEEN IT
IN A MOVIE.

666
00:26:33,625 --> 00:26:35,427
Tyra: IN YOUR PICTURES,
WE FEEL LIKE YOU POSE BETTER

667
00:26:35,427 --> 00:26:37,596
THAN ALL THE GIRLS HERE,

668
00:26:37,596 --> 00:26:40,132
BUT MODELING ISN'T ABOUT
BEING MECHANICAL.

669
00:26:40,132 --> 00:26:43,001
IT'S ABOUT EMOTIONALLY
CONNECTING WITH THE CAMERA.

670
00:26:43,001 --> 00:26:45,370
April: (sobbing)

671
00:26:49,508 --> 00:26:52,111
OF COURSE I WAS UPSET
WHEN THEY ELIMINATED ME.

672
00:26:52,111 --> 00:26:54,146
BUT HONESTLY I ONLY CRIED
FOR, LIKE, 30 MINUTES,

673
00:26:54,146 --> 00:26:57,382
AND THEN I GOT OVER IT,
DRIED MY EYES, TURNED AROUND,

674
00:26:57,382 --> 00:27:00,719
WENT BACK HOME AND DECIDED
TO KEEP PURSUING IT ANYWAY.

675
00:27:03,255 --> 00:27:05,624
I'M DOING A PHOTO SHOOT
FOR "STUFF" MAGAZINE TODAY.

676
00:27:05,624 --> 00:27:07,693
I'M REALLY EXCITED.

677
00:27:07,693 --> 00:27:10,429
I WANT TO BE A MODEL
PURELY BECAUSE I LIKE

678
00:27:10,429 --> 00:27:12,431
THE FEELING THAT I GET
WHEN I'M IN FRONT OF A CAMERA,

679
00:27:12,431 --> 00:27:14,666
AND I'M CREATING ART
WITH MY BODY.

680
00:27:14,666 --> 00:27:16,168
IT'S THE MOST AMAZING THING
I'VE EVER FELT.

681
00:27:16,168 --> 00:27:18,403
Man: MONEY.
THAT'S IT RIGHT THERE.

682
00:27:18,403 --> 00:27:20,139
April: IF I COULD
JUST GET THAT FEELING

683
00:27:20,139 --> 00:27:22,341
FOR AS MANY MOMENTS AS I CAN
FOR AS MANY DAYS

684
00:27:22,341 --> 00:27:24,209
OF THE REST OF MY LIFE,
I WILL DO IT.

685
00:27:24,209 --> 00:27:26,478
I WILL WORK HARD
TO BE A MODEL.

686
00:27:28,013 --> 00:27:29,648
Tyra: APRIL JUST SIGNED
WITH NEW YORK MODELS,

687
00:27:29,648 --> 00:27:31,617
AND THE OWNER OF THE AGENCY
IS SO IMPRESSED WITH HER

688
00:27:31,617 --> 00:27:34,119
THAT HE IS MANAGING HER
HIMSELF.

689
00:27:34,119 --> 00:27:36,588
♪♪♪

690
00:27:37,990 --> 00:27:40,425
Eric: YOU LOOK LIKE
A NUBIAN SPACE GODDESS.

691
00:27:42,561 --> 00:27:45,664
Nolé: XIOMARA--
ABSOLUTELY GORGEOUS GIRL,

692
00:27:45,664 --> 00:27:47,199
BUT SHE LOOKED LIKE
A WALRUS.

693
00:27:47,199 --> 00:27:48,734
Xiomara: I KNEW I WASN'T
PERFECT WALKING IN THE DOOR.

694
00:27:48,734 --> 00:27:50,369
I SO KNEW THAT.

695
00:27:50,369 --> 00:27:53,172
J.: GIRL, YOU WALK
LIKE YOU ARE ON CRACK.

696
00:27:53,172 --> 00:27:54,239
Xiomara:
I'M THE KIND OF PERSON

697
00:27:54,239 --> 00:27:55,440
WHERE SOMEONE TELLS ME
SOMETHING,

698
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:58,310
I WILL TAKE THAT AND
CHANNEL IT INTO POSITIVE.

699
00:27:58,310 --> 00:28:00,279
Betsey: XIOMARA.
ALL RIGHTY.

700
00:28:02,047 --> 00:28:04,383
Tyra: THE REASON WHY SHE'S HERE
IS HER ENERGY WAS SO GREAT.

701
00:28:04,383 --> 00:28:06,318
Xiomara:
I'M SO HOT!

702
00:28:09,321 --> 00:28:11,590
Tyra: SHE JUST HAS
THIS NEW YORK GIRL ATTITUDE.

703
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:13,258
Xiomara: I WAS BORN
IN BROOKLYN, BUT I HAVE

704
00:28:13,258 --> 00:28:15,494
THE CULTURAL EDGE OF BEING
RAISED IN NEW YORK.

705
00:28:15,494 --> 00:28:16,695
I JUST THINK THAT
NEW YORK HAS A FLAVOR

706
00:28:16,695 --> 00:28:19,164
AND A TRENDINESS
AND A VIBE.

707
00:28:19,164 --> 00:28:21,200
Tyra:
I LOVE IT.

708
00:28:21,200 --> 00:28:23,635
Andrew:
GOOD.

709
00:28:23,635 --> 00:28:26,638
Tyra: XIOMARA,
THE JUDGES LOVE

710
00:28:26,638 --> 00:28:29,141
YOUR PERSONALITY,
BUT ON PHOTO SHOOTS,

711
00:28:29,141 --> 00:28:33,111
YOU LOSE YOUR FOCUS AND
DON'T TAKE DIRECTION WELL.

712
00:28:33,111 --> 00:28:35,714
Tyra:
THANK YOU, XIOMARA.

713
00:28:35,714 --> 00:28:37,482
Xiomara: I'M ABSOLUTELY
MORE CONFIDENT

714
00:28:37,482 --> 00:28:39,117
SINCE BEING ON THE SHOW.

715
00:28:39,117 --> 00:28:40,519
I HAVE DEFINITELY IMPROVED
A LOT PHYSICALLY,

716
00:28:40,519 --> 00:28:44,323
EMOTIONALLY, MENTALLY.

717
00:28:44,323 --> 00:28:45,490
I'VE HAD TO WORK HARD
FOR EVERYTHING

718
00:28:45,490 --> 00:28:46,625
THAT I HAVE IN LIFE.

719
00:28:46,625 --> 00:28:47,993
I'M VERY DETERMINED.

720
00:28:47,993 --> 00:28:50,262
NOTHING'S EVER
JUST HANDED TO ME.

721
00:28:50,262 --> 00:28:51,530
I'M A NIGHTCLUB BARTENDER.

722
00:28:51,530 --> 00:28:53,432
THAT'S THE BEST WAY TO WORK
TWO NIGHTS A WEEK,

723
00:28:53,432 --> 00:28:57,035
MAKE A GRAND, WHERE YOU
HAVE MONDAY THROUGH FRIDAY

724
00:28:57,035 --> 00:29:01,006
TO GO ON WHATEVER CASTINGS
OR GO-SEES YOU HAVE TO GO ON.

725
00:29:01,006 --> 00:29:02,641
I'M GOING TO SEE
MY PERSONAL MANAGER,

726
00:29:02,641 --> 00:29:05,677
WHO I'M GONNA SIGN WITH
TODAY OVER AT T.T.A.

727
00:29:08,013 --> 00:29:11,350
HER JOB IS BASICALLY
TO CREATE SUPERSTARS

728
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:12,985
AS SHE'S DONE IN THE PAST.

729
00:29:12,985 --> 00:29:14,586
Marianne: FIRST OF ALL,
MY PLAN FOR YOU

730
00:29:14,586 --> 00:29:16,722
IS TO MAKE YOU A STAR.

731
00:29:16,722 --> 00:29:20,492
YOU LISTEN TO EVERYTHING
THAT I'VE TOLD YOU TO DO.

732
00:29:20,492 --> 00:29:23,996
I MEAN, YOUR HAIR-- I WANT IT
A LITTLE FULLER HERE.

733
00:29:23,996 --> 00:29:26,431
- Xiomara: THAT.
- Marianne: A LITTLE SOFTER.

734
00:29:26,431 --> 00:29:28,267
Xiomara:
MM-HMM. YEAH.

735
00:29:28,267 --> 00:29:33,238
Marianne: YOU ARE GOING TO BE
MY TOP GIRL.

736
00:29:33,238 --> 00:29:35,040
Xiomara: I GOT SIGNED
EXCLUSIVELY TO BOSS MODELS.

737
00:29:36,708 --> 00:29:39,077
I'M JUST REALLY EXCITED.

738
00:29:39,077 --> 00:29:40,245
James: I WAS AWARE OF HER
FROM THE SHOW,

739
00:29:40,245 --> 00:29:42,281
AND SHE CAME IN
