741
00:29:43,548 --> 00:29:45,150
SHE WAS VERY TALL,
STRIKING, BEAUTIFUL.

742
00:29:45,150 --> 00:29:46,752
- YOU OKAY?
- Xiomara: I'M OKAY.

743
00:29:46,752 --> 00:29:49,488
