744
00:29:49,488 --> 00:29:51,523
THE THING THAT HAS
CHANGED ME THE MOST

745
00:29:51,523 --> 00:29:54,059
FROM BEING ON THE SHOW IS
WALKING INTO THE ROOM

746
00:29:54,059 --> 00:29:57,162
WITH THE CONFIDENCE OF
SAYING, "YOU KNOW WHAT?

747
00:29:57,162 --> 00:29:59,164
I CAN OWN THIS ROOM.
I DESERVE TO BE HERE."

748
00:30:01,967 --> 00:30:04,636
RIGHT NOW IS
THE REAL COMPETITION.

749
00:30:04,636 --> 00:30:07,472
RIGHT NOW--RIGHT NOW.

750
00:30:07,472 --> 00:30:09,541
WHO'S MAKING MOVES? WHO'S NOT?

751
00:30:09,541 --> 00:30:12,277
WHO'S BOOKING WORK?
WHO'S NOT?

752
00:30:12,277 --> 00:30:14,146
THAT'S ALL.

753
00:30:14,146 --> 00:30:15,647
Tyra: XIOMARA
HAS HAD REQUESTS

754
00:30:15,647 --> 00:30:18,116
FROM THREE MAJOR
COSMETIC LINES,

755
00:30:18,116 --> 00:30:20,719
AND SHE JUST DID A SPREAD
FOR "FHM" MAGAZINE.

756
00:30:20,719 --> 00:30:23,555
♪♪♪

757
00:30:23,555 --> 00:30:24,723
Heather: I JUST LIKE
TO HAVE FUN.

758
00:30:24,723 --> 00:30:27,192
I'M A GIRL.
GIRLS LIKE TO HAVE FUN.

759
00:30:27,192 --> 00:30:28,560
(laughing)

760
00:30:28,560 --> 00:30:30,729
I LIKE DOING
SPONTANEOUS THINGS.

761
00:30:32,764 --> 00:30:35,567
I'M A VERY PEOPLE PERSON,
AND I'M VERY TALKATIVE,

762
00:30:35,567 --> 00:30:37,669
SO THAT'S THE ONLY THING
THAT BOTHERED ME,

763
00:30:37,669 --> 00:30:40,238
IS THAT I DID FEEL
A LITTLE BIT ALONE IN THE HOUSE.

764
00:30:40,238 --> 00:30:45,344
I'M ONLY 18 YEARS OLD, AND I'VE
NEVER BEEN AWAY FROM HOME.

765
00:30:45,344 --> 00:30:50,215
CATIE SEEMS TO UNDERSTAND ME,
AND IT MAKES ME HAPPY

766
00:30:50,215 --> 00:30:52,718
THAT SOMEONE ELSE
FEELS THE SAME WAY I DO.

767
00:30:52,718 --> 00:30:55,687
THAT I'M NOT ALONE
IN THIS HOUSE.

768
00:30:55,687 --> 00:30:58,757
Tyra: SOMETIMES WE THINK
YOU MAY LOOK A LITTLE TOO TEEN.

769
00:30:58,757 --> 00:31:02,694
