WITH HEATHER ON THE SHOOT

771
00:31:04,396 --> 00:31:06,431
JUST TO GET
HER FACIAL EXPRESSION

772
00:31:06,431 --> 00:31:08,266
TO LOOK SOMEWHAT
LIKE A MODEL.

773
00:31:08,266 --> 00:31:10,435
CLOSE YOUR MOUTH.
HEATHER'S OUT.

774
00:31:10,435 --> 00:31:12,437
Heather:
I AM JUST SHOCKED.

775
00:31:12,437 --> 00:31:14,373
I KNOW THAT I'M PRETTIER

776
00:31:14,373 --> 00:31:17,008
THAN A LOT OF THOSE GIRLS
STANDING UP THERE.

777
00:31:17,008 --> 00:31:20,045
SO I'M GOING
TO CONTINUE TRYING,

778
00:31:20,045 --> 00:31:23,582
AND I'M NOT GONNA
LET THIS DRAG ME DOWN.

779
00:31:23,582 --> 00:31:28,019
THIS HAS CHANGED MY LIFE BY ALL
THE DOORS OPENING FOR ME.

780
00:31:28,019 --> 00:31:30,355
Woman: HERE AT UPN,
WE OVERSEE THE CASTING

781
00:31:30,355 --> 00:31:32,090
OF ALL OF OUR
TELEVISION SERIES.

782
00:31:32,090 --> 00:31:34,025
I'D LOVE FOR YOU TO TAKE
A LOOK AT OUR SCRIPT,

783
00:31:34,025 --> 00:31:36,161
READ IT AND
GIVE IT YOUR BEST SHOT.

784
00:31:36,161 --> 00:31:37,295
Heather: I WANTED
