SUNFLOWER CAKE PAN.

786
00:31:40,132 --> 00:31:41,333
Woman:
IT'S JUST GREAT.

787
00:31:41,333 --> 00:31:42,434
I MEAN, IF YOU TAKE THE CLASSES
AND YOU PURSUE IT,

788
00:31:42,434 --> 00:31:44,469
YOU REALLY HAVE
A GOOD SHOT AT IT.

789
00:31:44,469 --> 00:31:46,671
Heather: I HOPE TO JUST
KEEP MODELING.

790
00:31:46,671 --> 00:31:49,508
HOPEFULLY, GET ANYTHING
IN ACTING, MODELING.

791
00:31:49,508 --> 00:31:50,475
I WANT IT ALL.

792
00:31:52,177 --> 00:31:54,546
DREAMS DO COME TRUE.

793
00:31:55,414 --> 00:31:58,116
COMING UP, HOT TIMES WITH
CAMILLE.

794
00:31:58,116 --> 00:32:03,355
MY CRAZY GIRLFRIENDS. WHEN WE GO
TO THE CLUB, IT'S ALWAYS VIP
ACCESS.

795
00:32:03,355 --> 00:32:05,357
AND A WINNER'S DREAM, COMES
TRUE.

796
00:32:05,357 --> 00:32:07,359
I'M PART OF LIKE, THE FASHION
OLMYPICS.

797
00:32:18,970 --> 00:32:20,071
Tyra: BELIEVE IT OR NOT,

798
00:32:20,071 --> 00:32:22,607
CAMILLE WAS SUPER SWEET
ON HER AUDITION.

799
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:24,209
SHE WAS DRESSED
A LITTLE FLASHY.

800
00:32:24,209 --> 00:32:25,677
SHE HAD ON, LIKE,
A GOLD LAMé SKIRT,

801
00:32:25,677 --> 00:32:27,579
BUT SHE WAS JUST REALLY
NORMAL, SWEET--

802
00:32:27,579 --> 00:32:29,581
ACTUALLY, A LITTLE BIT
TOO NORMAL AND SWEET.

803
00:32:29,581 --> 00:32:31,249
SO I WAS REALLY SHOCKED
THAT SHE TURNED OUT TO BE

804
00:32:31,249 --> 00:32:32,617
THE GIRL
THAT EVERYONE HATED.

805
00:32:32,617 --> 00:32:35,220
♪♪♪

806
00:32:38,757 --> 00:32:40,258
Camille: WHAT'S GONNA
DIFFERENTIATE ME

807
00:32:40,258 --> 00:32:41,493
