SOMETHING TO SAY TO YOU--

812
00:32:52,671 --> 00:32:55,006
- Yoanna: I DON'T TRUST YOU.
- Sara: WHOO!

813
00:32:55,006 --> 00:32:58,477
Camille: THE WHOLE EXPERIENCE
HAS BEEN AN INTERESTING ONE.

814
00:32:58,477 --> 00:33:02,581
EVERY SINGLE EMOTION
THAT YOU CAN POSSIBLY THINK

815
00:33:02,581 --> 00:33:06,485
WOULD RUN THROUGH YOUR SYSTEM
HAPPENED ON THAT SHOW.

816
00:33:06,485 --> 00:33:10,055
THE PERSON THAT I CAN SAY
THAT I GOT ALONG THE LEAST WITH

817
00:33:10,055 --> 00:33:12,524
HAS TO BE... YOANNA.

818
00:33:12,524 --> 00:33:15,193
Yoanna: WAIT. JUST--
I'M NOT FINISHED! JUST WAIT.

819
00:33:15,193 --> 00:33:17,028
Camille: I HONESTLY THINK
TO THIS DAY THERE IS SOMETHING

820
00:33:17,028 --> 00:33:18,530
ABOUT MY PERSONALITY,

821
00:33:18,530 --> 00:33:21,032
SOMETHING ABOUT
MY CONFIDENCE LEVEL

822
00:33:21,032 --> 00:33:24,102
THAT I THINK THAT
YOANNA SAW IN ME,

823
00:33:24,102 --> 00:33:28,073
AND SHE WISHED THAT
SHE POSSESSED HERSELF.

824
00:33:28,073 --> 00:33:30,675
Yoanna: CAMILLE-- SHE'S
SUCKING ALL OF OUR ENERGY OUT,

825
00:33:30,675 --> 00:33:34,412
AND SHE IS SO MANIPULATIVE
AND SO SNEAKY ABOUT IT.

826
00:33:34,412 --> 00:33:36,481
Camille: I CAN HELP YOU
GUYS OUT IN SOME WAYS.

827
00:33:36,481 --> 00:33:38,049
Sara: I CAN TELL THAT
CAMILLE'S GONNA BE SOMEBODY

828
00:33:38,049 --> 00:33:40,285
THAT'S GONNA CAUSE
A LOT OF PROBLEMS.

829
00:33:40,285 --> 00:33:44,389
I THINK SHE JUST REALLY BELIEVES
THAT SHE'S THE... THE STUFF.

830
00:33:44,389 --> 00:33:46,725
Jay: YOU HAVE
15 MINUTES TO ACHIEVE

831
00:33:46,725 --> 00:33:49,594
A GLAMOROUS SMOKY EYE.

832
00:33:49,594 --> 00:33:51,663
GO.

833
00:33:51,663 --> 00:33:53,632
- Women: (shouting)
- Yoanna: AAH!

834
00:33:53,632 --> 00:33:55,567
SURPRISE, SURPRISE.

835
00:33:55,567 --> 00:33:58,103
CRUELLA DE VIL
STEALS THE MIRROR.

836
00:33:58,103 --> 00:33:59,404
Xiomara: CAMILLE HAS
A HUGE ASS.

837
00:33:59,404 --> 00:34:01,439
HER BUTT IS TAKING UP
THE WHOLE COUNTER SPACE.

838
00:34:01,439 --> 00:34:03,141
Jenascia: OH, MY GOD.
I WAS SO PISSED OFF.

839
00:34:03,141 --> 00:34:05,477
LIKE, SERIOUSLY, I JUST
WANTED TO STOP AND SCREAM.

840
00:34:05,477 --> 00:34:07,245
Camille: IT'S A COMPETITION,
NOT A SORORITY.

841
00:34:07,245 --> 00:34:09,547
Mercedes:
CAMILLE IS MANIPULATIVE.

842
00:34:09,547 --> 00:34:13,284
Yoanna: CAMILLE--IT'S LIKE,
DRAMA, DRAMA, DRAMA, DRAMA.

843
00:34:13,284 --> 00:34:14,319
Eric: GROUND CONTROL
TO CAMILLE.

844
00:34:14,319 --> 00:34:16,154
Janice: OKAY,
IF YOU COULD BE A JUDGE

845
00:34:16,154 --> 00:34:20,292
AND ELIMINATE ANYONE,
WHO WOULD IT BE?

846
00:34:20,292 --> 00:34:21,693
Camille: OOH,
THAT'S A HARD QUESTION.

847
00:34:21,693 --> 00:34:23,261
- Sara: IT'D BE CAMILLE.
- April: CAMILLE.

848
00:34:23,261 --> 00:34:24,496
- Xiomara: CAMILLE.
- Yoanna: CAMILLE!

849
00:34:24,496 --> 00:34:26,764
Camille:
OH... MY... GOD.

850
00:34:26,764 --> 00:34:28,266
Michael: (Italian accent)
OKAY, SHE WANTS TO KNOW

851
00:34:28,266 --> 00:34:29,234
