852
00:34:29,234 --> 00:34:30,435
Camille:
THIS IS MY SIGNATURE WALK,

853
00:34:30,435 --> 00:34:32,036
AND THIS IS WHAT'S GOING
TO MAKE ME FAMOUS.

854
00:34:32,036 --> 00:34:36,440
ACTUALLY, I'M HERE BECAUSE
I GOT CHOSEN OUT OF 6,000 GIRLS.

855
00:34:36,440 --> 00:34:38,143
Janice: CAMILLE,
WHAT WERE YOU THINKING?

856
00:34:38,143 --> 00:34:39,244
Nigel: TIME AND TIME AGAIN,

857
00:34:39,244 --> 00:34:40,645
WE'VE TALKED TO YOU
ABOUT ATTITUDE.

858
00:34:40,645 --> 00:34:42,647
