861
00:34:45,750 --> 00:34:47,652
Tyra: I DON'T THINK
THIS IS THE PLACE FOR HER--

862
00:34:47,652 --> 00:34:49,020
THIS COMPETITION.

863
00:34:49,020 --> 00:34:50,322
I THINK SHE NEEDS TO BE
SOMEWHERE TELLING PEOPLE

864
00:34:50,322 --> 00:34:52,657
